<title>GERMANY: Brau &amp; Brunnen share suspended from trade.</title>
<headline>Brau &amp; Brunnen share suspended from trade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German brewing and drinks group Brau und Brunnen were suspended from trade on the Duesseldorf stock exchange ahead of a key management meeting, the Duesseldorf bourse said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Brau und Brunnen's supervisory board is slated to meet this morning to discuss a far-reaching reorganisation.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
